    "summary": "Bearer: a **WARPSMITH** model.\n\nWhenever the bearer's unit makes a [Dark Pact](vsdata:ability/chaos-space-marines.dark-pacts), it can re-roll its [Leadership rolls](vsdata:core-rule/leadership-rolls).\n\nAfter the bearer's unit has shot in [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), if it made a Dark Pact and its attacks **destroyed** at least one enemy model, the unit **heals** 3 wounds.",
